The [[Lucky Clover]] is a rare item available in the shop for [[Ranger]]s. It can also be generated from the [[Mega Clover]]. Two are required for multiple [[Ranger]] recipes: [[Fortuna's Hope]], [[Fortuna's Grace]], and [[Lucky Piggy]], all of which generate {{icon/luck}} more effectively than a plain [[Lucky Clover]]. When using the [[Ranger Bag]] default class, one [[Lucky Clover]] is provided at the start of the run.
== Trivia ==
The [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Four-leaf_clover Four-leaf clover] is a rare variation of the common three-leaf clover. According to traditional sayings, such clovers bring good luck, though it is not clear when or how this idea began.

